cff-version: 1.2.0
title: rf-detr-ggml (vendored subset)
message: >-
  If you use this code, cite interactor-rf-detr-ggml and RF-DETR.
abstract: >-
  The RF-DETR graph that rfdetr_seg.elf runs: ops, the DINOv2 backbone, the
  projector, deformable attention, the decoder, keypoints and the
  segmentation head, src/{ops,backbone,projector,deform_attn,decoder,keypoints,segmentation}.{cpp,h},
  copied byte for byte into src/ here. tools/check_vendor.exs checks every
  file against the commit below.
